<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-scrībo</span></b> , scripsi, scriptum,
		3, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to write between</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alia interscribere alia rescribere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 7, 9, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of the phœnix: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in cauda (phoenicis) caeruleus interscribitur
					nitor,</span>”
				i. e. <i>is intermingled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 33</span></i>
			.— 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Of the agate: interscribentes eum venae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>running between</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
